{
  "sections": {
    "breadcrumbs": {
      "type": "breadcrumbs",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "text_alignment": "start",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "ss_badge": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<span class=\"ss-pdp-badge\">Spécial peaux sensibles</span>"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "ss_rating": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-rating', product: product %}"
          }
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_type": "shopify_swatch",
            "swatch_style": "circle",
            "swatch_size": 32,
            "button_style": "normal",
            "size_title": "Size",
            "size_chart_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_quantity_selector": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout": false,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": false
          }
        },
        "ss_complements": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-complements', items: \"serum-tout-en-un-104-multi-boosting-serum-the-c||Ta peau est propre et prête\", title: \"La suite de ta routine\", note: \"Enchaîne avec le sérum tout-en-un de la ligne 104.\" %}"
          }
        },
        "ss_facts": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ss-pdp-facts\"><div><b>Pour qui</b>Peaux sensibles et tous types de peau</div><div><b>Texture</b>Micro-mousse prête à l&#x27;emploi</div><div><b>Format</b>Flacon pompe 150 ml</div></div>"
          }
        },
        "reassurance": {
          "type": "icon-with-text",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "vertical",
            "title_font": "body",
            "title_size": "text-base",
            "icon_1": "check",
            "heading_1": "<strong>Sélection Sunsoari</strong> : marques choisies avec exigence",
            "icon_2": "truck",
            "heading_2": "<strong>Livraison suivie</strong> en France métropolitaine",
            "icon_3": "check",
            "heading_3": "<strong>Paiement sécurisé</strong> : CB, Apple Pay, PayPal"
          }
        },
        "sticky_atc": {
          "type": "sticky-atc-bar",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "all",
            "style": "minimalist",
            "container": "full",
            "show_atc_button": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout_buttons": false,
            "show_quantity": true
          }
        },
        "acc_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Composition (INCI)",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Water, Lauryl Hydroxysultaine, Glycerin, Disodium Cocoamphodiacetate, Sodium Methyl Cocoyl Taurate, Sodium Chloride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Citric Acid, Coco-Glucoside, Hexylene Glycol, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Peel Oil, Butylene Glycol, Sodium Phytate, Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake), Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Flower Oil, Thymus Mastichina Flower Oil, Glycyrrhiza Uralensis (Licorice) Root Extract, Citrus Unshiu Peel Extract, Ziziphus Jujuba Fruit Extract, Zingiber Officinale (Ginger) Root Extract, Cinnamomum Cassia Bark Extract, Angelica Gigas Root Extract, Pueraria Lobata Root Extract, Ascorbic Acid, Limonene.</p><p><em>Cette liste peut évoluer : se référer à l'emballage du produit acheté.</em></p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Précautions",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Usage externe. Éviter le contact avec les yeux ; en cas de contact, rincer abondamment à l'eau claire. En cas de réaction inhabituelle, cesser l'utilisation et consulter un médecin. Conserver à l'abri du soleil et de la chaleur.</p><p>Contient des huiles essentielles et du limonène.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ss_badge",
        "title",
        "ss_rating",
        "price",
        "description",
        "variant_picker",
        "buy_buttons",
        "ss_complements",
        "ss_facts",
        "reassurance",
        "acc_1",
        "acc_2",
        "sticky_atc"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        "@media (min-width: 1280px) {.product {padding-inline: 5rem; }}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "use_color_scheme_in_container": false,
        "enable_sticky_info": true,
        "media_size": "large",
        "gallery_layout": "vertical-carousel",
        "mobile_thumbnails": "show",
        "show_image_border": false,
        "enable_image_zoom": true,
        "enable_video_looping": true,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
    "ss_why": {
      "type": "ss-story",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Nettoyage doux",
            "text": "<p>Ses micro-bulles fines éliminent les impuretés du quotidien en respectant la peau.</p>",
            "tag": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Prête à l'emploi",
            "text": "<p>La pompe délivre directement une mousse fine.</p>",
            "tag": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tradition et formulation moderne",
            "text": "<p>Inspiré du Moju de Jeonju et de ses ingrédients botaniques.</p>",
            "tag": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "show_price": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "b1",
        "b2",
        "b3"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "layout": "cards",
        "background": "cream",
        "align": "center",
        "eyebrow": "Pourquoi on l'aime",
        "heading": "Doux, mais efficace",
        "text": "",
        "columns": 3,
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "ratio": "1/1",
        "open_first": false
      }
    },
    "ss_steps": {
      "type": "ss-story",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Mouille</strong> ton visage, matin et soir."
